🟡 中危 问题4 — loadFilters 静默吞异常，下拉选项加载失败无感知
文件：frontend/src/views/reports/EmployeeWorkHoursReportView.vue　位置：约第 360 行
问题描述：loadFilters 的 catch {} 为空块，接口失败时仅把三个选项数组置空，用户看到「所属部门/员工/项目名称」下拉全空却无任何错误提示，会误以为系统无数据。触发条件：筛选选项接口超时或返回 5xx。
// ❌ 当前代码
```
async function loadFilters() {
  try {
    const resp = await fetchEmployeeWorkHourFilters()
    departmentOptions.value = resp.departments || []
    employeeOptions.value = resp.employees || []
    projectOptions.value = resp.projects || []
  } catch {
    departmentOptions.value = []
    employeeOptions.value = []
    projectOptions.value = []
  }
}
```
修改建议：保留降级（清空选项）的同时给出用户可见提示，便于排查；该接口失败不应阻塞主表加载，onMounted 中的调用顺序可保持不变。验证：DevTools 将该请求改为 500 或离线后刷新页面，确认出现「筛选项加载失败」提示且主表格仍正常加载。
// ✅ 正确做法
```
async function loadFilters() {
  try {
    const resp = await fetchEmployeeWorkHourFilters()
    departmentOptions.value = resp.departments || []
    employeeOptions.value = resp.employees || []
    projectOptions.value = resp.projects || []
  } catch (err) {
    departmentOptions.value = []
    employeeOptions.value = []
    projectOptions.value = []
    ElMessage.warning(err?.message || '筛选项加载失败，请稍后重试')
  }
}
```
